WEBVTT

00:09.030 --> 00:11.430
I couldn't eat another bite...

00:11.430 --> 00:12.630
Missus.

00:16.370 --> 00:21.370
Missus, it is nearly time for 
your tea party with Queen Laura!

00:26.670 --> 00:29.230
I overslept!

00:30.390 --> 00:31.650
Please be careful!

00:31.650 --> 00:32.820
My clothes!

00:32.820 --> 00:35.260
I have your clothes ready over here!

00:35.260 --> 00:38.070
Huh? Did you say something?

00:38.070 --> 00:39.460
M-Missus!

00:39.460 --> 00:40.960
Maria!

00:40.960 --> 00:42.340
Ahem!

00:42.340 --> 00:43.450
Huh?

00:44.260 --> 00:45.390
Lily?

00:47.820 --> 00:51.040
This will not do!

00:53.950 --> 00:55.290
Say, Maria...

00:55.290 --> 00:56.260
Yes, missus?

00:56.260 --> 01:00.180
Don't you think Lily has been acting more 
and more like Mistress Laila recently?

01:00.180 --> 01:02.410
It appears they have much in common.

01:02.410 --> 01:05.180
They even attended the theater 
together recently.

01:05.180 --> 01:09.110
Wuh? Really? They should've invited me too.

01:09.110 --> 01:12.780
They said they enjoyed a wonderful
 dinner together afterward.

01:12.780 --> 01:15.770
Huh! I wish I could've gone.

01:17.620 --> 01:20.640
Wuh? I've never seen those doors open before.

01:20.640 --> 01:21.750
Is it a shortcut?!

01:21.750 --> 01:23.190
Missus!

01:40.450 --> 01:42.400
Wuh?

01:48.770 --> 01:51.300
I've never seen this room before.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.980
Missus!

02:05.640 --> 02:07.120
Oh dear!

04:04.180 --> 04:05.950
<i>Huh?</i>

04:07.850 --> 04:09.100
What is it?

04:09.100 --> 04:11.340
O-Oh, it's nothing!

04:11.340 --> 04:15.620
It is not respectable behavior 
to stare so rudely at someone

04:15.620 --> 04:17.940
when you have nothing in particular to say.

04:18.400 --> 04:19.740
I'm sorry.

04:19.740 --> 04:23.530
Gracious, Laila, you're so frightening.

04:23.950 --> 04:29.460
And Lettie, it's lovely to see you again.
I believe the ghost scare was the last time.

04:29.950 --> 04:36.420
Since then, nobody has gotten caught in 
the traps, so I've been a little bit lonely.

04:36.420 --> 04:40.660
Erm, I heard that you
 wanted to see me urgently.

04:39.950 --> 04:41.180
Ahem!

04:41.500 --> 04:42.590
<i>Glare.</i>

04:47.370 --> 04:52.940
I wanted to have a nice 
long talk with you today, Lettie.

04:52.940 --> 04:54.150
I see...

04:54.150 --> 04:59.360
So, what do you think of 
Clarke's personality and stuff?

05:00.060 --> 05:00.990
<i>Oh, wuh?</i>

05:04.330 --> 05:05.950
Please answer the question.

05:06.490 --> 05:09.960
I find him extremely stubborn and pushy.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.210
He is sincere and gentle!

05:12.210 --> 05:13.960
Oh my!

05:13.960 --> 05:14.960
<i>Hmm?</i>

05:15.460 --> 05:18.150
Okay, what about his face?

05:18.740 --> 05:20.400
His face?

05:20.400 --> 05:22.080
That's right.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.730
I think he has a pretty face.

05:24.730 --> 05:26.720
He is a handsome gentleman!

05:26.720 --> 05:28.130
Eek!

05:26.720 --> 05:28.130
My!

05:28.130 --> 05:30.320
Wuh?! No, I only meant...

05:30.320 --> 05:35.640
In other words, you're fond of Clarke?

05:35.640 --> 05:36.670
Huh?!

05:39.100 --> 05:40.070
Hmm?

05:40.710 --> 05:42.390
I hate him.

05:44.340 --> 05:48.850
You aren't a very good liar, now are you?

05:48.850 --> 05:50.440
It's most obvious.

05:53.030 --> 05:57.450
Lettie, you've always been 
very honest about your feelings.

05:57.450 --> 06:00.810
You haven't changed one bit.

06:01.820 --> 06:06.010
Clarke was your first love, after all.

06:08.350 --> 06:09.360
Wuh?

06:10.980 --> 06:12.520
My firts wuv?!

06:16.520 --> 06:19.780
So you got them to take the exterior lock off?

06:19.780 --> 06:23.440
That's right. They said they aren't 
worried about me escaping anymore.

06:23.440 --> 06:24.790
Well, that's good news.

06:24.790 --> 06:28.590
Now I can finally get down 
to some work in the garden!

06:28.590 --> 06:30.250
I would be happy to assist.

06:30.760 --> 06:32.080
Thanks, Maria!

06:32.520 --> 06:34.880
Aren't you moving back to your other room?

06:34.880 --> 06:37.330
Huh? No, I'm not.

06:37.330 --> 06:42.590
How come? I hear they've already 
finished the window repairs.

06:42.970 --> 06:47.590
Prince Clarke also said it would be
 all right if you wished to switch rooms.

06:47.590 --> 06:49.580
I told him I'm fine right here.

06:49.580 --> 06:51.370
With bars on the windows?

06:51.370 --> 06:54.100
They're kind of charming 
once you get used to them.

06:54.100 --> 06:56.600
Plus, it's quiet and relaxing here.

06:56.600 --> 07:00.000
Well, so long as it's what you want...

07:00.000 --> 07:03.120
Oh, right! There's something 
I need to ask you two!

07:03.120 --> 07:04.000
What is it?

07:04.000 --> 07:04.860
Yes?

07:07.050 --> 07:10.620
Can you tell me what exactly "love" is?

07:10.620 --> 07:11.690
Huh?

07:10.620 --> 07:11.690
Hmm?

07:11.690 --> 07:13.620
Where's this coming from?

07:13.990 --> 07:15.710
I'm just a little curious.

07:15.710 --> 07:18.140
No, I'm super curious!

07:18.140 --> 07:21.630
Missus, you asked the right person!

07:21.630 --> 07:24.920
Love is different for everyone, 
so there isn't one simple definition,

07:24.920 --> 07:28.010
but as for myself, I do not 
care about money or status.

07:28.010 --> 07:32.380
I'd be willing to give up everything 
for an overwhelming, even suffocating love

07:32.380 --> 07:34.640
that sets my heart ablaze with passion!

07:34.640 --> 07:36.680
Is this your new thing?

07:36.680 --> 07:42.100
Incidentally, I am particularly into big, 
beefy men who are even stronger than I am.

07:42.100 --> 07:43.150
Huh.

07:43.150 --> 07:45.540
Well, you are the physical type, Maria.

07:45.540 --> 07:47.440
Oh, sure. She totally looks it.

07:47.440 --> 07:50.290
What about you? Have you been in love before?

07:52.990 --> 07:54.000
I have.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.000
Really?!

07:55.000 --> 07:58.040
When? Where? With whom?!

07:58.040 --> 07:59.500
Pipe down.

07:59.500 --> 08:04.030
My first love is a really precious memory. 
I keep it locked up deep in my heart.

08:04.760 --> 08:07.760
What was it like falling 
in love for the first time?

08:07.760 --> 08:09.880
Let's see...

08:09.880 --> 08:14.260
Even just remembering it makes me feel 
at ease and brightens my day, I guess.

08:15.110 --> 08:18.600
That's lovely. It sounds like magic.

08:18.600 --> 08:20.270
Love is magic!

08:20.270 --> 08:24.570
Sometimes I catch myself wondering 
about how he's doing now,

08:24.570 --> 08:29.610
and it makes me want to stay true to myself 
in case I run into him again one day.

08:29.610 --> 08:30.780
That's what it's like.

08:30.780 --> 08:32.250
Whoa.

08:32.250 --> 08:33.810
That's lovely.

08:34.580 --> 08:38.040
So, who was your first love anyway?

08:38.040 --> 08:39.580
Not telling.

08:39.580 --> 08:41.660
Aw, you're so stingy!

08:42.570 --> 08:47.200
But I will tell you one thing. It truly 
takes a miracle for first love to last.

08:47.200 --> 08:48.200
Does it?

08:48.200 --> 08:52.750
Yeah. So maybe it's best to hold on
 to it as a treasured memory.

08:54.190 --> 08:58.110
Really? It truly doesn't last? Never?

08:59.060 --> 09:01.520
Well, I guess I can't say <i>never</i>.

09:01.520 --> 09:03.940
Why are you getting so 
worked up about it anyway?

09:05.130 --> 09:07.190
Oh, I was just wondering.

09:07.570 --> 09:11.970
I can't blame you for dreaming, though. 
Honestly, I feel the same way.

09:11.970 --> 09:15.950
"Hey, you hot, rich oil barons! 
Come and sweep me off my feet!"

09:15.950 --> 09:16.880
You know?

09:16.880 --> 09:20.210
I dream of a knight with strong arms 
throwing me over his shoulder!

09:20.210 --> 09:23.290
Yikes. That's pretty problematic, Maria.

09:23.290 --> 09:24.990
Do you think it'll ever happen?

09:24.990 --> 09:25.960
Y-You're serious?

09:36.720 --> 09:37.720
Love.

09:40.050 --> 09:41.090
Love!

09:42.730 --> 09:43.730
Love?

09:46.570 --> 09:47.810
Love...

09:48.230 --> 09:51.360
What the heck even is love?! 
This is so confusing!

11:59.840 --> 12:03.660
I know who these kids are.

12:23.920 --> 12:25.930
Father!

12:26.400 --> 12:30.460
Hey, can I go tree climbing?

12:30.460 --> 12:32.440
Not here, honey.

12:32.440 --> 12:34.090
Why not?

12:34.090 --> 12:37.770
Lettie, be a good girl and settle down, okay?

12:38.710 --> 12:43.380
I apologize for that. By the way, 
regarding the upcoming inspection,

12:43.380 --> 12:47.800
don't you think it somewhat unfeasible 
to ask individuals to fund it themselves?

12:54.020 --> 12:58.110
Whoa! It's so big!

13:02.220 --> 13:06.230
Up I go, up I go...

13:10.740 --> 13:13.980
Oh, wow!

13:21.550 --> 13:22.850
Oops...

13:29.230 --> 13:31.310
It smells so sweet!

13:56.470 --> 13:58.020
Hey! You there!

14:24.570 --> 14:28.880
Hey! Watch out! If you're 
not careful, you might fall!

14:32.430 --> 14:34.930
Hey! Wake up!

14:35.310 --> 14:36.250
Huh?

14:36.250 --> 14:37.810
Wuh? Oh no!

15:25.530 --> 15:27.350
It smells so sweet.

15:29.560 --> 15:30.470
Lettie?

15:34.800 --> 15:36.390
Prince Clarke...

15:39.560 --> 15:41.000
This is so boring.

15:41.000 --> 15:46.010
All I do every day is study and exchange 
pleasantries with royalty. I'm sick of it!

15:58.230 --> 15:59.880
What? An animal?

16:00.610 --> 16:01.640
Huh?

16:12.890 --> 16:13.790
Hmm?

16:20.640 --> 16:25.150
Hey! Watch out! If you're 
not careful, you might fall!

16:29.090 --> 16:31.560
Hey! Wake up!

16:32.040 --> 16:33.170
Huh?

16:33.170 --> 16:34.810
Wuh? Oh no!

16:34.810 --> 16:36.090
Ah!

16:36.770 --> 16:38.050
Whoa!

16:42.540 --> 16:44.720
Phew...

16:48.680 --> 16:50.110
You okay?

16:51.070 --> 16:52.040
Wuh?

16:54.000 --> 16:55.620
Thank you!

16:55.620 --> 16:57.800
Oh, sorry! I'll move.

16:58.440 --> 16:59.890
Lettie!

16:59.890 --> 17:01.120
Father!

17:01.470 --> 17:04.160
Prince Clarke, are you injured at all?

17:04.160 --> 17:05.960
No, I'm all right.

17:05.960 --> 17:09.510
I cannot apologize enough 
for my daughter's behavior.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.920
Come on. You need to apologize too.

17:11.920 --> 17:13.400
I'm sorry!

17:15.640 --> 17:17.640
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

17:18.910 --> 17:22.150
Have you ever slept in a tree? It's great!

17:22.470 --> 17:24.670
Come here, Leticia.

17:27.390 --> 17:30.480
Now then, Prince Clarke, please excuse us.

17:30.840 --> 17:31.950
Sure.

17:35.930 --> 17:37.610
Leticia...

17:47.590 --> 17:48.710
Lettie!

17:49.130 --> 17:51.090
It's too dangerous up there!

17:54.830 --> 17:56.180
Lettie?! What are you—

17:58.180 --> 17:59.270
Huh?

18:03.310 --> 18:04.390
Ah!

18:05.800 --> 18:08.510
Leticia! What are you doing?!

18:08.510 --> 18:09.880
What if you got hurt?

18:11.760 --> 18:16.760
I was sure you'd catch me 
in your arms this time.

18:17.700 --> 18:18.710
Huh?

18:20.560 --> 18:22.150
I remembered.

18:24.470 --> 18:25.640
Everything.

18:28.470 --> 18:31.680
Prince Clarke, I'll make 
a flower crown for you.

18:31.680 --> 18:32.790
For me?

18:32.790 --> 18:34.970
Yeah! Just one sec.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.510
Hmm...

18:39.510 --> 18:41.980
I can't get it just right.

18:43.840 --> 18:44.990
Let me see.

18:57.010 --> 18:58.480
There! Done.

18:58.480 --> 18:59.730
Wuh?

18:59.730 --> 19:02.230
Oh, wow!

19:02.230 --> 19:03.310
Here.

19:03.310 --> 19:05.480
Thank you! Oh...

19:08.470 --> 19:09.480
Leticia.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.590
What?

19:14.150 --> 19:17.070
I want you to... please be my wife!

19:18.600 --> 19:20.620
I mean, that is...

19:20.620 --> 19:24.310
Sure! I'll be your wife, Prince Clarke!

19:24.310 --> 19:26.130
Really? Oh!

19:38.120 --> 19:42.190
This isn't all one big flower garden 
like it used to be.

19:42.190 --> 19:46.820
That was ten years ago. 
Everything changes over time.

19:46.820 --> 19:51.680
I was so consumed by my daily duties, 
I think I forgot something very dear to me.

19:52.170 --> 19:55.830
It seems that memories can fade and wither too.

19:56.390 --> 20:01.200
As soon as I met you, 
my world started to shine so brightly.

20:01.770 --> 20:06.200
Your smile was like a flower 
that brought vibrant color to my life.

20:06.840 --> 20:09.160
That will never fade.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.750
Prince Clarke...

20:11.590 --> 20:15.520
When you fell from the tree, 
I fell in love with you.

20:15.520 --> 20:20.510
That was the first time I'd ever felt so warm 
inside, like my heart was full.

20:21.200 --> 20:22.420
The first...?

20:22.420 --> 20:23.200
Hmm?

20:23.850 --> 20:27.960
Prince Clarke, was I your first love?

20:29.060 --> 20:31.460
Mm-hmm. You sure were.

20:34.040 --> 20:40.310
I made a sincere promise to myself 
that only I would decide how to live my life.

20:40.310 --> 20:43.970
That if I got married, it would
 only be to someone I truly loved.

20:45.180 --> 20:48.370
And that's you, Prince Clarke.

20:48.980 --> 20:49.580
Huh?

20:49.580 --> 20:52.860
If I'm totally honest, your face 
and voice are totally my type.

20:52.860 --> 20:56.280
Although you are pushy, you're really 
sweet on me. I don't actually hate that.

20:56.280 --> 20:59.710
And you always come to my rescue.

21:07.760 --> 21:09.530
I don't hate that at all.

21:28.120 --> 21:29.310
It suits you.

21:31.610 --> 21:33.290
Thank you, Leticia.

21:33.290 --> 21:36.000
I should be thanking you instead.

21:36.000 --> 21:40.700
Thank you for never giving up on me.

21:43.410 --> 21:44.870
Prince Clarke...

21:47.170 --> 21:48.680
I love you!

23:19.920 --> 23:39.940
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:25.050
I will give up my right to the throne in order to keep her happy

23:20.920 --> 23:25.930
You're running away together for love?

23:21.920 --> 23:26.930
It's almost like an adventure novel!

23:22.920 --> 23:27.930
Now then, Young Master, I am in a hurry

23:23.920 --> 23:28.930
You hadn't heard yet, Uncle?

23:25.930 --> 23:30.930
What, pray tell, are you two talking about?

23:27.300 --> 23:32.310
Quit talking at the same time!

23:28.800 --> 23:33.810
Come on, would you two calm down?

23:30.350 --> 23:35.350
Astarl is always interesting

23:31.810 --> 23:36.810
Oh dear. Perhaps I should speak to somebody about this

23:37.270 --> 23:39.940
It's quiet. Let's run away
